<title>BRAZIL: Bahia cocoa arrivals 21,187 bags in latest week.</title>
<headline>Bahia cocoa arrivals 21,187 bags in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bahia cocoa arrivals were 21,187 bags in the week ending February 23 compared to 36,197 bags in the corresponding period last year, the Brazilian Trade Commission Comcauba said in a statement.</p>
<p>Total arrivals for the 1996/97 crop to-date were 2,773,825 bags against 2,527,077 bags in 1995/96, it added.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
